    ],
    "text": "My No.: KIDS/LND/01/ACQ/21.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      426.0,
      309.92,
      484.07
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice to you that under Sub-section (1) ofsection 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by LandAcquisition (Amended) Act No. 28 of 1964, and theGovernment intends to acquire the following land which isrequired for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.96,
      498.0,
      282.04,
      508.07
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      517.2,
      309.92,
      575.27
    ],
    "text": "Lots 392 in Sheet No. 24 of Supplementary No. 24, F.V.P.325 prepared by Superintendent of Survey, Ratnapura,situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of Matuwagalain Uda Pattu North of Kuruwiti Korale, Ratnapura District,Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.96,
      589.2,
      196.01,
      599.27
    ],
    "text": "What is the Public Purpose :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      607.2,
      310.0,
      629.27
    ],
    "text": "To be distributed among victims of sudden disasters andvillage expansion programmes.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      330.0,
      561.95,
      364.07
    ],
    "text": "Claimant: Balangoda Plantation Company Limited, LandReform Commission, State Plantation Corporation; Extent:4.4617 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      380.4,
      562.37,
      486.47
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land is herebyrequired to appear personally or by agents duly authorized inwriting before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kiriella at 10.00a.m. on 13th February, 2019 and are here by required to notifyme in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 30th January,2019 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars oftheir claims for compensation for the acquisition of the saidland, the amount of compensation, the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
